 work at Corbin Development, don't you?", "time": "23000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le09ob06re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Black suit</span>: Yes, we do.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Black suit</span>: What are you doing in this neck of the woods?\nWell, actually, I will be doing some research on Corbin. I was thinking of putting in a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 here.\nI was wondering if I could have a few minutes of your time and ask you some questions.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Black suit</span>: Sure, you will be heading this way, won't you? Walk with us. We are just grabbing coffee.", "time": "50000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}